{"source":{"site":"活俠傳 wiki","url":"https://smilin.net/LoM-wiki/","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","commit":"23a4783d","version":"v1.0.6001","date":"2026-11-10"},"pages":[{"id":"system/develop-list","kind":"forge","title":"開發項目列表","tags":[],"blocks":[{"type":"p","text":[{"text":"// 舊網址相容：帶著 #錨點 轉到新頁（項目與分類的錨點名稱沿用）。// 用相對路徑，簡中頁（由這頁自動轉出）也會轉到簡中的新頁import { onMounted } from \"vue\";onMounted(() => location.replace(\"forge-roadmap\" + location.hash));"}]},{"type":"p","text":[{"text":"開發項目列表已併入"},{"text":"鍛冶場、煉丹房開發路線圖","to":"system/forge-roadmap"},{"text":"。"}]}]},{"id":"system/forge-roadmap","kind":"forge","title":"鍛冶場、煉丹房開發路線圖","tags":["Forge Roadmap","forge roadmap","development","forge","pills"],"blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"depth":0,"text":[{"text":"點開發樹上的項目，可展開該項目的數值表、獲得方式與備註。"}]},{"depth":0,"text":[{"text":"卡片與連線顏色代表開發階層：第一階綠色、第二階橘色、第三階紅色。"}]}],"ordered":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"text":[{"text":"鍛冶場 - 裝備 - 武器"}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"text":[{"text":"鍛冶場 - 裝備 - 防具"}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"text":[{"text":"鍛冶場 - 暗器 - 平射"}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"text":[{"text":"鍛冶場 - 暗器 - 拋射"}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"text":[{"text":"鍛冶場 - 暗器 - 陷阱"}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"text":[{"text":"煉丹房 - 毒藥"}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"text":[{"text":"煉丹房 - 靈丹"}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"text":[{"text":"備註"}]},{"type":"list","items":[{"depth":0,"text":[{"text":"取消開發項目時，退回已投資的鍛造／煉丹點數 90%、銀兩 90%。"}]},{"depth":0,"text":[{"text":"項目解鎖後，若取消並再回頭開發時，不需再滿足解鎖條件的等級。但項目需正確，如護心鏡仍需唐門制服處於開發中。"}]},{"depth":0,"text":[{"text":"已獲得的項目才能解鎖，若未獲得，即便滿足開發條件，也不會在未來獲得時直接解鎖。"}]},{"depth":0,"text":[{"text":"本條目資料參考"},{"text":"活俠傳資料彙總","href":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/10wN_Kfusr5ipzXVzvNewsPHmn3HNCNUtqME26t94I4o"},{"text":"、"},{"text":"活俠傳事件及分歧整理","href":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YZRvCuf7ar5eqHCEJoVRdD1uxhTtkKBBCuF_0O0OdNg"},{"text":"、"},{"text":"活俠傳事件分岐資料庫","href":"https://mortal-web-database.vercel.app/"},{"text":"撰寫。"}]}],"ordered":false}]}],"skipped":[]}
